      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Do a pull up by pulling your chin towards the bar. Then come back slowly
        to the starting position. Your segments\u2019 length, your strength, and
        your shoulders\u2019 mobility will determine how high you can pull yourself
        up.\n\nConsider using a resistance band to reduce the difficulty by wraping
        it on the bar and step on it :)"
